{"date":"2006-07-21","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/db/e6/113327_61mmv.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/db/e6/113327_61mmv.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/db/e6/113327_61mmv.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/db/e6/113327_61mmv.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/db/e6/113327_61mmv.jpg"},"summary":"12岁的DJ（米切尔•莫索 Mitchel Musso 饰）是个爱幻想的家伙。他整天觉得对面街的老头子的那座荒废的老屋阴森怪气，附近的一些物体经常不翼而飞。经过详细观察，DJ发现原来失踪的物品都被老屋吃了，那么老头子失踪的老伴应该都是被吃了，DJ心想。不过大人们甚至伙伴们都觉得DJ在异想天开。 \r\n　　万圣节前的一天，DJ和伙伴乔德（山姆•勒纳 Sam Lerner 饰）不小心将篮球扔到了老屋门前，他们眼睁睁的看着一股神秘力量将篮球吸进了屋内，就连新搬来的伙伴珍妮（史宾塞•洛克 Spencer Locke 饰）也差点成了老屋的美味。伙伴们这下相信了DJ的说法，不过大人们却依然觉得他们在扯蛋。为了阻止老屋继续吃人作恶，伙伴们决定携手与它作战到底。","name":"Monster House","name_cn":"怪兽屋","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":57,"total_count":86835},{"name":"动画电影","count":44,"total_count":43866},{"name":"奇幻","count":28,"total_count":472513},{"name":"剧场版","count":28,"total_count":725366},{"name":"2006","count":25,"total_count":34282},{"name":"恐怖","count":24,"total_count":9190},{"name":"3D","count":20,"total_count":51147},{"name":"童年","count":11,"total_count":93119},{"name":"惊悚","count":11,"total_count":8591},{"name":"电影","count":8,"total_count":13584},{"name":"动画","count":7,"total_count":35738},{"name":"MitchelMusso","count":4,"total_count":4},{"name":"看过，印象不深","count":3,"total_count":58},{"name":"AMBLIN","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"RobSchrab","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"美国","count":2,"total_count":27140},{"name":"原创","count":2,"total_count":620948},{"name":"悬疑","count":1,"total_count":113982},{"name":"2000s","count":1,"total_count":3087},{"name":"アニメ映画","count":1,"total_count":2862},{"name":"少年","count":1,"total_count":1590},{"name":"DanHarmon","count":1,"total_count":22},{"name":"80-90","count":1,"total_count":60},{"name":"ImageMovers","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"Steven_Allan_Spielberg","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"Sony_Pictures_Animation","count":1,"total_count":